          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 45,
      "label": "team_0110_nelke_04",
      "hash64": "AAF266C21941D70C",
      "text": "原本我以為那應該不太可能，\\n但想不到仙后竟然是真老大……\\r\\n而且，恐怕仙后的真實身分是……[VAR 0x0114(001E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
